  "_comment": "Starter spec for build-diagram.mjs. Generic ingest -> index -> analyse -> alert architecture with no customer content. Copy it, rename ids and labels, keep the structure: nodes sit on a col/row grid, boundaries span whole grid cells, nodes name their boundary as `parent`.",
